        "title": "Carbonates and Phosphates",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The carbonate-silicate cycle (Urey reaction):\n  CaSiO₃ + CO₂ ⇌ CaCO₃ + SiO₂\n  Over millions of years this sequesters atmospheric CO₂ into rock\n  Reverse reaction (volcanic outgassing) returns CO₂ to atmosphere\n  → Earth's long-term thermostat mechanism\n```"
    },
