        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCaCO₃ (limestone) + CO₂ + H₂O → Ca²⁺ + 2HCO₃⁻ (dissolution in soil)\nCa²⁺ + 2HCO₃⁻ → CaCO₃ + CO₂ + H₂O (precipitation in cave)"
    },
