      "text": "Stalactite: hangs from ceiling (drip at tip)\nStalagmite: grows from floor (drip at base)\nMemory aid: stalacTITE = ceiling; stalaGMITE = ground\nColumn: stalactite + stalagmite meet\nFlowstone: sheet deposits on floors and walls\nCave pearl: concentric calcite around grain in pool\n```"
